Yeah, I've read your book and you talk about that and your book very honestly.
是的，我读过你的书，你非常诚实地谈论了这一点和你的书。

01:06:28.239 --> 01:06:36.639
Well, you know what I noticed watching you play Arthur, I was like, when you would get angry, you'd never wink and are not like, I'm not like this guy.
好吧，你知道我在看你扮演亚瑟时注意到了什么，我当时想，当你生气时，你永远不会眨眼，也不会，我不像这个人。

01:06:36.639 --> 01:06:39.920
Like, you really seem like you're really angry, but I also never turned on you.
就像，你看起来真的很生气，但我也从来没有对你生气过。

01:06:39.920 --> 01:06:41.800
Like I never was like, that guy seems like a jerk.
就像我从来没有那样，那家伙看起来像个混蛋。

01:06:41.800 --> 01:06:43.960
Like I'm just delighting in your anger somehow.
就像我只是以某种方式享受你的愤怒一样。

01:06:43.960 --> 01:06:44.800
That's the thing, Bob.
就是这样，鲍勃。

01:06:44.800 --> 01:06:49.599
I think everything you do, and this is why I was not surprised that you made the leap to drama and now to action.
我认为你所做的一切，这就是为什么我对你从戏剧到行动的飞跃并不感到惊讶。

01:06:49.599 --> 01:06:57.639
I believe you in everything you do, and I always see like that warmth and goodness in your eyes and every year for every role you're in.
我相信你所做的一切，每年你扮演的每一个角色，我总是在你眼中看到温暖和善良。

01:06:57.639 --> 01:07:11.911
I mean, I've talked about this before, but I do think while I, in some ways I've found my place place in this lane, you know, and it feels more impactful, my presence in this specific lane.
我的意思是，我之前已经谈过这一点，但我确实认为，虽然我在某些方面找到了自己在这条车道上的位置，但我在这条特定车道上的存在感觉更有影响力。

01:07:11.911 --> 01:07:15.611
